        <li><span>02</span><strong>Validate</strong><small>Check browser and server rules</small></li>
        <li><span>03</span><strong>Act</strong><small>Run the selected callback</small></li>
        <li><span>04</span><strong>Restore</strong><small>Render the updated state</small></li>
    </ol>
</section>

